    "summary": "Brooch made of silver in the shape of a goat with full stomach containing an American football, a hammer, a teddy bear, a spanner, a can of baked beans, a shoe and a cowboy boot. The goat&#039;s body is made of cast silver, the stomach contents of stamped silver sheet. The eye is a set turquoise. On the back of the brooch are three marks, &quot;Sterling&quot; referring to the silver, and &quot;Clarence Lee&quot; and &quot;LE&quot; with a circle underscoring it, referring to the maker.",
